<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tyndall year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tyndall year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     22.69 vs 16.97</p>
<p>    Net profit			     22.07 vs 17.08</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		3.5  vs 3.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Tyndall Australia Ltd is a financial services group and is 52 percent owned by Sir Ron Brierley's Guinness Peat Group Plc. Tyndall also announced a 1-for-10 bonus issue.</p>
</text>
